;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
; coding informations
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
C0,Central Electronics I (J519) Coding
C1,0?xxxxx: Steering Column Memory (0 - not installed / 1 - installed)
C2,0x?xxxx: Footwell Lightning (0 - Light Bulps / 1 - LED)
C3,0xx?xxx: Headlight Type
C4,0 - Halogen Headlights w/o Headlight Washer System
C5,1 - Halogen Headlights with Headlight Washer System
C6,2 - Bi-Xenon Headlights
C7,3 - Bi-Xenon Headlights with AFS
C8,0xxx?xx: Automatic Driving Light
C9,0 - w/o Automatic Driving Light (Auto)
C10,1 - with Automatic Driving Light (Auto) with Rain/Light Sensor (G397)
C11,0xxxx?x: Daytime Running Lights
C12,0 - w/o Daytime Running Lights
C13,1 - with Daytime Running Lights (not selectable via MMI)
C14,2 - with Daytime Running Lights (selectable via MMI)
C15,0xxxxx?: Coutry
C16,1 - Rest of World (RoW)
C17,2 - Northern European Countries (Sweden/Finland/Norway/Denmark)
C18,3 - USA
C19,4 - Canada
;
